OL,3,GNEWSAA12 road closure paused for
OL,4,Afootball match
OL,5,
OL,6,FOvernight road closures on a busy
OL,7,Fstretch of the A12 are set to be paused
OL,8,Ffor one night for a football match.
OL,10,FIpswich Town host Premier League
OL,11,Fchampions Arsenal in the Carabao Cup
OL,12,Fnext Tuesday at 20:00 BST.
OL,14,FNational Highways started work on
OL,15,FMonday to repair Birchwood bridge which
OL,16,Fcrosses the A12, after it was hit by a
OL,17,Fvehicle. The work is set to run for
OL,18,Fthree weeks, with a section of the road
OL,19,Fclosed southbound between 21:00 and
OL,20,F05:00.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
